    "table_18.4-1": "기계 및 전기비구조요소의 설계계수 (Mechanical and electrical nonstructural component design coefficients). Columns: ap (증폭계수), Rp (반응수정계수), omega_0p (초과강도계수). Footnote a: ap=1 for rigidly attached, ap=2.5 for flexibly attached. Footnote b: For power generation equipment, if vibration isolators included, clearance >6mm requires 2x values. Footnote c: omega_0p applies when concrete/masonry uses non-ductile anchors."
